          "lineage": "Pulvinomyzostomum",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "and description. Holotype free-living (Fig. 8 D). Body elongate. Length ~ 6 mm; width ~ 4 mm following fixation. Dorsal surface furrowed (Fig. 8 E). Body margin acirrate (Fig. 8 G). Mouth and cloaca subterminal on ventral surface, midway between first and last pairs of parapodia and body margin. Five pairs of parapodia. Color in life unknown, pale yellow following fixation.",
